&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold;"&gt;NOTE E &amp;#8211; OTHER REGULATORY ASSETS AND LIABILITIES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt;In accordance with FERC regulations, the Company collects fuel from its shippers in order to cover operational gas usage as well as lost and unaccounted for gas.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt;The over or under collection of fuel is calculated on a monthly basis.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt; The Company prepares an annual filing with the FERC to update the fuel rate necessary to balance fuel collected versus fuel used.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt;The Company records under collections of the deferred fuel balance as a regulatory asset and over collections as a regulatory liability, which are valued using the posted index prices of the applicable approved tariffs, which approximate market rates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt;The Company recorded a regulatory asset of $68,794 at December 31, 2025 and a regulatory asset of $114,603 at December 31, 2024.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; -aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8.65pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold;"&gt;NOTE F - PROVISION FOR INCOME TAXES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Garamond;"&gt;The following table reflects the components of the provision for income taxes for the years ended December 31:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
